Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:06.35,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You? Working?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.35,0:00:09.31,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Yeah. Jun's birthday's coming up, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:13.96,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I want to give him a present, \Nbut I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:18.21,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Do you know what kinds of jobs high \Nschool kids are allowed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:20.80,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,O-Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:23.96,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,The ones where you say, like, \N"Welcome!" and stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.65,0:00:26.54,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,They call it the service industry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.75,0:00:31.12,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Even if you don't like how your boss or \Nthe customers look, you can't punch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:33.36,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,How about I punch {\i1}you{\i0} first?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.07,0:00:36.39,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I guess I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:37.55,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:40.93,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,The idea of sending you off \Nto work alone worries me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.93,0:00:42.64,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,so I'll work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:43.98,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:46.82,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Thanks! That makes me feel a lot better!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.82,0:00:48.40,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Let me in on it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.37,0:00:51.72,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, you wanna work part-time, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:53.69,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:56.15,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Wait, what? You wanna work part-time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.15,0:00:58.19,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Then why don't all of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:01.49,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,work at my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:17.97,italics,OP,0,0,0,,When I throw a jab or a straight,\N it always lands
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:23.10,italics,OP,0,0,0,,But when I'm aiming for your heart,\N I miss every time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:28.44,italics,OP,0,0,0,,Parallel, zigzagging, awkward, incoherent
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.44,0:01:32.94,italics,OP,0,0,0,,When you look my way and move closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.94,0:01:38.70,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I know it doesn't mean the same thing for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.70,0:01:43.74,italics,OP,0,0,0,,But I wish we could stay like this forever
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:49.88,italics,OP,0,0,0,,My changing feelings are driving me crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:55.17,italics,OP,0,0,0,,The moment you turn to face me,\N take that! Telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.17,0:02:00.64,italics,OP,0,0,0,,If only we could feel the same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:05.52,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I want to kick this pesky subtlety away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:11.52,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I want to know everything, \NI want to know everything
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.52,0:02:14.07,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I can't fool you forever
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:16.69,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I can't keep this hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.69,0:02:21.45,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I want to shout out my secret, AHHH
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.37,0:02:25.91,italics,OP,0,0,0,,Take that! Telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.91,0:02:28.37,italics,OP,0,0,0,,Te-te-te-telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:31.46,italics,OP,0,0,0,,Telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.25,0:02:37.01,sign_3603_13_I_Want_to_Be_See,Title,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,150)\fsp6\fad(515,1)}My First {\3c&H5A5659&\c&HEBEBEB&}P{\c&H5A5659&\3c&HEBEBEB&}art-Time Job
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:35.55,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,"My First Part-Time Job."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.01,0:02:40.43,sign_5683_24_God_Ramen_Tatsum,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&H797677&\3c&HDDDBDB&}God {\c&H6C6A6A&}Ramen {\c&H7454E3&}Tatsumi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.01,0:02:40.43,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Welcome, welcome! This is \Nmy family's restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:42.47,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,Tatsumi's told me about you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:44.89,sign_5683_24_God_Ramen_Tatsum,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&H797677&\3c&HDDDBDB&\an7}God {\c&H6C6A6A&}Ramen {\c&H4441B2&}Tatsumi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.47,0:02:44.89,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,I'm his dad, Tatsuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:46.72,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,Glad to have you on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:48.23,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,H-Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:49.60,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Thank you for letting us work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:50.56,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:53.73,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,Boy, you have no idea how much \NI appreciate you doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:57.48,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,My wife and I were running \Nthis restaurant on our own,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:03:01.45,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,but just recently, she...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:05.33,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,went home to visit her family!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:09.71,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,Come back to me, Kiyomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:12.75,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Don't mind him. This happens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.54,0:03:16.59,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:19.84,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Do I really have to work in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:22.05,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Yay! It's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.05,0:03:26.18,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I got those in case \Nwe ever got any female help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:27.77,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,This was your idea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:30.43,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,These don't look much like \Nramen shop uniforms!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:33.40,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,In that case, I'm okay with not \Nbeing a ramen shop anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:34.61,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Come on, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:37.36,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,That's the uniform. \NWhat other choice is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:37.44,sign_5683_24_God_Ramen_Tatsum,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&H797677&\3c&HDDDBDB&\an7}God {\c&H6C6A6A&}Ramen {\c&H4441B2&}Tatsumi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:38.82,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Just shut up and wear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:41.78,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,So why aren't {\i1}you{\i0} wearing it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:44.70,sign_5683_24_God_Ramen_Tatsum,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&H797677&\3c&HDDDBDB&\an9}God {\c&H6C6A6A&}Ramen {\c&H4441B2&}Tatsumi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:46.58,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,Okay, we're open!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:49.75,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,We got a customer! Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:53.29,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Uh... Wel...co...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.67,0:03:55.21,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:57.84,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Will this seat at the counter be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:59.13,main,Guy Customer1,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.96,0:04:03.26,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Hi there. Whatcha wanna eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:05.39,main,Woman Customer1,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:07.81,main,Woman Customer1,0,0,0,,What would you recommend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.81,0:04:08.81,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Recommend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:11.85,main,Woman Customer1,0,0,0,,Yeah. What do you think tastes the best?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:15.56,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Oh! Well, I like cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.56,0:04:17.40,main,Woman Customer1,0,0,0,,Huh? You have that here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:19.23,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.19,0:04:22.86,sign_5683_24_God_Ramen_Tatsum,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&H797677&\3c&HDDDBDB&\an7}God {\c&H6C6A6A&}Ramen {\c&H4441B2&}Tatsumi\N{\c&H2F2424&}5 Toppings {\c&H482DCC&}FREE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:22.90,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You're clearly useless at \Ndealing with customers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:26.24,sign_5683_24_God_Ramen_Tatsum,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&H797677&\3c&HDDDBDB&\an7\fs15}God {\c&H6C6A6A&}Ramen {\c&H4441B2&}Tatsumi\N{\c&H2F2424&}5 Toppings {\c&H482DCC&}FREE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.15,0:04:25.03,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,so at least be a panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.03,0:04:26.24,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:28.16,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Hey, Tomo-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:31.20,main,Carol,0,0,0,,What noise do pandas make?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:35.58,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh? They're like bears, \Nso... I guess they roar?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.04,0:04:42.38,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:45.97,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Thank you for your patronage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:47.18,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Come again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.43,0:04:49.64,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,When we're working side by side like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:52.64,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,it almost feels like you \Nmarried into my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:56.90,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I didn't quite catch that.\N Could you say it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:05:00.61,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,I said it feels like you \Nmarried into my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.61,0:05:01.86,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:04.36,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,It... It feels like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:05.78,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Can you still say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:08.45,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.66,0:05:15.75,main,Guy Customer2,0,0,0,,Miso ramen with a side of gyoza, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:17.62,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:18.83,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Welco—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:21.92,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Tomo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:27.76,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Hey, Kubojun! Good to see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:30.30,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Hey, Tanabe... What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:32.39,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,There was one outside, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:34.22,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Well, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:35.56,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.39,0:05:38.40,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Allow me to show you to your seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:41.40,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,You're... Gundo, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:44.44,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You would forget the face \Nof a childhood friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:47.57,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Forgive my rudeness, sir, \Nbut are you a chicken or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:50.20,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Right this way. Your seat is over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.03,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Yep, that's Gundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:56.00,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey, Tanabe! What did you mean by "again"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.79,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Does he come here that often?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:06:00.42,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, once a week or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:04.05,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me sooner?!\N I'll throttle you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.05,0:06:05.76,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:09.72,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Well? What do you think of \NTomo in her waitress uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:14.47,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I was surprised, but... \NI mean... I guess it's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:18.56,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,"I guess it's nice"? \NWhat do you think that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:20.44,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I think that means it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:22.94,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Here's your char siu ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:24.44,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:26.99,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Go on and laugh if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.99,0:06:27.86,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.07,0:06:31.82,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I mean, I look ridiculous in this, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:36.66,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,No, I... don't think it looks bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:41.63,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,"Not bad"? What do you think that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:43.59,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I think that means it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:45.80,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Great meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:49.26,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very much. Please come again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:52.18,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,This feels kinda weird, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:54.35,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna keep working here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:57.22,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh? Just until the end of the long weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.22,0:07:00.35,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll come back tomorrow, \Nthen. Keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:09.95,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I brought some customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:12.91,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.91,0:07:14.20,main,Guy Customer3,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.79,0:07:25.04,sign_5683_24_God_Ramen_Tatsum,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&H653929&\3c&H875B49&}God {\c&H65402F&}Ramen {\c&H664042&}Tatsumi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.37,0:07:25.04,sign_13038_125_Angry_,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)\pos(320,300)\c&HF9FCF8&\3c&H111224&}3 Days Later
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.04,0:07:26.92,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,Great work, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:29.26,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,These have been a fun few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:31.68,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,And here's your pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:35.14,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Boss... Thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:37.31,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Yay! Money!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:39.98,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Isn't this more than you promised us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:43.31,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,Since you all worked so hard,\N I added a bit extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.31,0:07:45.90,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I think that was to be expected, \Ngiven that we produced results.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:47.52,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:49.90,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Did she squeeze it out of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:52.86,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Will the shop be okay without us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:57.20,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Don't worry! It's about time for Mom to \Nmake her periodic trip back here, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:08:01.00,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,If I'm being honest, I'd love to \Nhave you keep working here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:04.08,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,We'd be glad to come back and \Nhelp you out occasionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:05.67,main,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,What? Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:09.38,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,There aren't many employers that \Ngive workers so much freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:11.88,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I wanna come back again, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:15.14,italics,Tatsuro,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm making a \Ndeal with the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:19.60,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Jun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:22.18,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:24.56,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You waited to meet me \Nafter work again today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:27.06,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Well, Tomo, see you at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:27.65,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.02,0:08:30.57,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I'll walk home with Misuzu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:31.36,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Not so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.03,0:08:37.28,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You actually came to the restaurant \Nevery day of our break.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.57,0:08:38.70,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You that bored?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.45,0:08:41.25,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I went because you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:46.50,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I figured if you went on some wild rampage,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:49.21,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,they'd need someone around \Nwho could stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:51.76,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?! What do you think I am, exactly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:52.72,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:55.72,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I've eaten their ramen tons of times,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:09:00.68,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,but for some reason, it seemed to taste \Nbetter when you brought it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:03.52,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,So... you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:05.14,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:07.65,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:16.95,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I can really have this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:19.49,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Yep. It's your birthday present.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.49,0:09:21.29,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,It's just a cheap one, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:23.62,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,That's totally fine! It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:27.17,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Incidentally, I wear the same one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.17,0:09:28.71,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,That doesn't bother you, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.71,0:09:30.63,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Of course it doesn't bother me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:32.96,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,As long as it's you, I wouldn't \Nmind matching from head to toe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:34.67,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,H-Head to toe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.67,0:09:37.38,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I mean, that'd be cool, right?\N Like we're a team!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:40.35,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh... Right, a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.26,0:09:43.89,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,It hasn't been like this in so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:47.85,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I thought he'd changed recently, \Nbut I guess Jun is still Jun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.27,0:09:49.77,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I bought cake, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.77,0:09:52.40,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wanna have a birthday party at your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:57.66,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,My mom's... gonna be home late tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:09:59.70,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.70,0:10:03.16,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,S-So if we're having a party, \Ncan it be at your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:05.12,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I'm sure Akemi-san will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:07.62,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:10.92,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Maybe something really is different!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:17.01,sign_3603_13_I_Want_to_Be_See,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(515,1)\frz-5.23\pos(327,135)\fsp.3}The Abandoned Cinderel{\3c&H5A5659&\c&HEBEBEB&}la
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:15.92,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,"The Abandoned Cinderella."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:19.55,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Misuzu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:24.10,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What can I do to make Jun see me as a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.10,0:10:26.06,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Haven't heard that in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:29.23,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Things have been going \Ngreat lately, thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.23,0:10:30.94,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I figure if I'm gonna push, now's the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:32.77,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Got any ideas that'll work quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:34.73,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Let him touch your chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:35.48,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.82,0:10:38.07,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:39.95,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,The chest would be too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:43.20,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,but sharing bodily contact is the \Nquickest way to move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:46.54,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Sharing contact? But it's \Nnot that easy to just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.83,0:10:49.83,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:51.17,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.17,0:10:55.17,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Yes. All you have to do is stand facing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:57.26,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Then I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.51,0:11:00.05,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,push him into you from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.05,0:11:01.72,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What's with you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:05.68,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,A regular push probably won't \Nbe enough to even budge him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:07.31,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,so I'll push him down from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.31,0:11:08.73,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:11.77,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,It's fine as long as you catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.77,0:11:14.06,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,That's not the issue here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:15.65,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Ah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.94,0:11:19.03,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You don't feel confident \Nthat you could catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:20.11,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:24.03,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:27.33,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I can catch a Jun or two, no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:31.04,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Perfect. I changed the subject to muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:34.04,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What're you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:38.05,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Hey, Tomo. What are you doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.42,0:11:40.09,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm ready anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:41.88,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:45.35,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Huh? Bring what on? What are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.31,0:11:47.60,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Is this girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:50.39,italics,Junichiro,0,0,0,,trying to flat-out kill me now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:54.77,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Now, go. And put on a pathetic \Ndisplay of confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:56.65,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Just like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:11:58.73,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.73,0:12:00.99,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.78,0:12:05.45,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?! He dodged me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.82,0:12:08.20,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Jun-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.71,0:12:18.13,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Ooh. Bad Jun-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:21.55,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Sorry! It wasn't on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:25.09,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Let me make it up to you! \NIf there's anything I can do, name it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.09,0:12:27.60,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Aw, that's okay, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:31.06,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,It is {\i1}not{\i0} okay! Treat yourself better!\N In various ways!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:33.10,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:38.19,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Tomo, do it! Don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:41.24,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Are you sure? None of this was your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:43.20,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I'm sure! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:45.66,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,More!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.45,0:12:47.62,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,More!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:55.08,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What I did today was way \Nover the line, even for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:58.75,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What in the world am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:02.67,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Misuzu-cha—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.13,0:13:05.43,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Is this divine retribution?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:10.22,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.22,0:13:12.31,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,You okay, Misuzu-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:16.10,italics,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Must be my lucky day, to have \NMisuzu-chan fall on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:19.61,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Tanabe-kun. \NYou're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.94,0:13:20.57,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:22.65,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What's wrong with you, Misuzu-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:25.78,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Not only did you apologize, \Nbut you're showing concern for me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:27.95,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Did you hit your head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:29.12,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.74,0:13:33.25,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You saved me by cushioning my fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:35.62,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Should I do something to thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:36.96,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,That's not necessary!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:38.92,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You don't need to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:42.92,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Right now... I just feel \Na pressing need to atone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:45.47,italics,Tanabe,0,0,0,,I don't quite get it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:47.97,italics,Tanabe,0,0,0,,A chance like this doesn't come every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.97,0:13:50.05,italics,Tanabe,0,0,0,,What should I ask her to do, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:53.93,italics,Tanabe,0,0,0,,How far can I go? Should I just \Npush as far as I dare? Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.93,0:13:55.06,italics,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:58.23,italics,Tanabe,0,0,0,,I thought about it too long! \NShe's almost back to her usual self!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:03.98,main,Tanabe,0,0,0,,I-I'd really like to... swap contact info!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:07.49,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Okay, then. I got off a lot \Neasier than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:10.12,italics,Tanabe,0,0,0,,Damn it! I could've gotten more?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:12.79,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Hey, Misuzu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:15.62,main,Carol,0,0,0,,What was that all about earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:17.25,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I finally realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:21.59,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,It seems I don't want Tomo and \NJunichiro to get together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:22.38,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.30,0:14:27.55,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,All this time, all I've \Ndone is get in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:29.84,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:34.18,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I don't think you're as \Nbad as you think you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:35.31,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Carol...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.31,0:14:36.60,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Misuzu-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:38.69,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:41.44,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Even now, I still can't get away with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:49.99,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Misuzu's pretty late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:51.28,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Did she oversleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:53.91,main,Carol,0,0,0,,She said she was staying home sick today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:56.95,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I didn't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.95,0:14:58.71,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,How did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:01.17,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I got a message from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.17,0:15:03.13,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Why'd she only tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:06.51,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Don't get all smug!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.09,0:15:10.05,main,Nakao,0,0,0,,We'll start homeroom now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.88,0:15:15.56,main,Nakao,0,0,0,,Today, we'll assign parts for our production \Nof {\i1}Cinderella{\i0} at the cultural festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.30,0:15:16.14,sign_24990_290_Cultural_Festiva,Text,0,0,0,,{\move(415,50,515,50)}Cultural Festival \N{\fs11}"Cinderella" \N\N• Cinderella \N• Prince \N• Stepmother \N• Stepsister 1 \N• Stepsister 2 \N• Fairy Godmother
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.18,0:15:19.69,main,Nakao,0,0,0,,Who should play the part of Cinderella?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:23.56,sign_13038_125_Angry_,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)\pos(320,300)\c&HF9FCF8&\3c&H111224&}3 Days Later
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:27.32,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I've never taken this many days off before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:29.90,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I just can't bring myself to face Tomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.41,0:15:41.83,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,There are many things I want to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:44.71,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,but first, why did you come to the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.71,0:15:48.51,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I would've felt bad making you \Ngo downstairs when you're sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:50.34,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,That's a favor I never asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:51.93,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't play tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:54.72,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I bought all kinds of sweet \Nstuff for ya! Want 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:56.06,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:58.68,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I've got those things that \Ncool your forehead down, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:15:59.89,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:01.81,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.81,0:16:04.69,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What is all this? \NYou're not acting like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:08.69,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Well, lately it seems like {\i1}she's{\i0} the \Nonly one you wanna be friends with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:13.07,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,It's great that you're getting \Nalong so well with Carol...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:16.87,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,but you've been avoiding me, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:23.46,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I think my cold just came back.\N I'm going to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:25.33,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey! No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:26.84,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.09,0:16:31.59,sign_26783_312__Cinderella_,Text,0,0,0,,"Cinderella"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:30.84,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Here. It's the script for \Nour cultural festival play.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:31.59,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Read up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.05,0:16:37.43,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,If you don't like me anymore, \NI can't help that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:40.56,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,But if that's not the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:42.81,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,you're probably just overthinking things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:51.15,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Overthinking... Yeah, maybe to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.74,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,No matter how horrible \NI made myself out to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:58.74,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'd just smile and \Nforgive me like it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:02.16,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,But that's exactly why I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:10.30,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What the hell is this about \Nme being Cinderella?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:12.38,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,C-Calm down, Misuzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:15.22,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm a girl, and they're \Nmaking me play the prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:17.59,main,Carol,0,0,0,,The whole class decided together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.59,0:17:19.60,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Who gave my name first?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.01,0:17:20.76,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:22.35,flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:25.02,flashback,Carol,0,0,0,,Misuzu-chan should be Cinderella!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:26.73,main,Carol,0,0,0,,That was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:30.27,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You're gonna rip her cheeks off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:31.19,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.19,0:17:34.03,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,So you finally showed up, Cinderella.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:35.24,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.07,0:17:39.16,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You think you're in any \Nplace to make fun of me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:40.49,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You're playing a tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.49,0:17:42.95,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah! You're a tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.95,0:17:46.00,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Quit making things even more \Ncomplicated when you're a tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:52.25,sign_28915_334_Cinderella__Act_,Text,0,0,0,,Cinderella \NAct 1 \N"Cinderella's House"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.25,0:17:49.63,main,Nakao,0,0,0,,We'll begin the play practice now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:51.92,main,Nakao,0,0,0,,Everyone with a part, come up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:55.63,sign_24990_290_Cultural_Festiva,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(75,35)\c&HDBDCD1&}"Cinderella" \NAct 1 \N{\fs11}"Cinderella's House"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:55.63,main,Tominaga,0,0,0,,Cinderella, hurry up and prepare our dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:59.85,main,Matsumura,0,0,0,,Hey, Cinderella! You'd better have \Nfinished the laundry I told you to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:03.81,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Cinderella, have you \Nfinished cleaning my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:06.27,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Clean your own damn room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.27,0:18:08.02,main,Tominaga,0,0,0,,Sh-She's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:09.44,main,Matsumura,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:11.40,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:14.15,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down! It's just play practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:16.36,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Why is {\i1}she{\i0} playing the stepmother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:18.74,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I can't concentrate in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:20.37,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Let's practice our lines somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:22.08,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:25.70,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Greetings, my prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:28.79,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wh-What a beautiful l-lady you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:31.09,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,W-Would you d-dance with—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.09,0:18:33.05,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Literally no one is {\i1}this{\i0} awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.05,0:18:36.01,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Well, I mean, I've never acted before!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:37.34,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,How do I even do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.63,0:18:41.18,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,In your case, you could probably \Njust talk the way you normally do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.35,0:18:43.56,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What a beautiful lady you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:46.27,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Would you dance with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.23,0:18:51.15,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,See? That's no good at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.15,0:18:53.73,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,It's perfect, you lady-killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.65,0:18:59.20,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You're so lucky. You and \NCarol make great princesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.20,0:19:02.91,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Hardly. This isn't my kind of thing, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:06.04,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say I wish I could \Nbe a princess or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.25,0:19:11.08,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,but if I'm the type to play a prince, \Nno one's ever gonna see me as a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:16.46,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I don't see why there couldn't \Nbe princesses like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:17.26,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:21.26,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Having you play Cinderella might \Nbe a bit too much to ask, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.26,0:19:24.26,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You could be a bandit princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.26,0:19:26.18,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,How about I rob {\i1}you{\i0} blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.77,0:19:29.18,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Well, we should be heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:30.02,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:34.44,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Tomo says she wants to \Ngo out with Junichiro,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:37.94,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,but she's convinced herself that \Nshe's not worthy of that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:40.70,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,And it's all because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:43.66,flashback,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Then why not act more like a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:47.08,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I put that curse on Tomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:49.50,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Now I have to undo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:52.25,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,There's no one else who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:02.05,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Tomo-chan, you look so handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.05,0:20:05.01,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Really? This is kinda embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:11.35,main,Girl3,0,0,0,,Th-The binder busted loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.35,0:20:13.19,main,Girl4,0,0,0,,We need to wrap her tighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.15,0:20:19.40,main,Noda,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:20.86,main,Fukaya,0,0,0,,She's a princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:23.36,main,Girl3,0,0,0,,Aizawa-san, you've got a knack for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.36,0:20:24.82,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:27.28,main,Tominaga,0,0,0,,That dress looks great on you, Olston-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:28.62,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.62,0:20:31.04,main,Tominaga,0,0,0,,Hey, can I call you "Carol-chan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:32.16,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:34.08,main,Matsumura,0,0,0,,Oh! Then I will, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:37.50,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Everyone else is moving forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:39.42,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,yet only I'm still...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.01,0:20:41.55,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Something bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:45.68,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Since it's you, I'm guessing it's about Tomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:47.18,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:50.98,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I bet you're only thinking of roundabout \Nways to deal with it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:54.23,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Why don't you try facing \Nher head-on for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.69,0:20:58.77,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Damn it! I can't get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.19,0:21:01.61,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You're the last person \NI want to hear that from.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.11,0:21:07.62,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,All the prep's on track. Now we just \Nwait for the festival to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:10.58,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You're so laid-back about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.58,0:21:12.87,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I've got nothing but stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:15.87,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,If you've got nothing to do, \Nhelp me practice my lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.87,0:21:19.84,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,No way. Cinderella's basically \Nthe only character you talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.01,0:21:23.22,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Jun as... Cinderella?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:27.64,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wh-What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:30.06,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Just do it! It doesn't bother me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.51,0:21:33.18,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Yeah, it might not bother {\i1}you{\i0}, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.99,0:21:36.24,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wait! Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.24,0:21:38.81,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I want to know more about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.81,0:21:42.43,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I-I'm very sorry, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.43,0:21:45.83,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I have to g-g-go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.19,0:21:48.01,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,F-Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.01,0:21:49.33,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.02,0:21:52.71,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Look, can we please stop now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:55.68,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,This is kinda fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.68,0:21:57.70,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Help me out a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.70,0:21:58.58,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:22:01.37,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Please don't go, Cinderella!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.37,0:22:03.51,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I-I can't stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.51,0:22:09.13,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Please remove your hand, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.89,0:22:14.64,italics,ED,0,0,0,,(This suspicious behavior is...)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.64,0:22:18.94,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Hey, you know, I'm all mixed up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.94,0:22:23.40,italics,ED,0,0,0,,It's too complicated, I'm freaking out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.40,0:22:25.94,italics,ED,0,0,0,,I want to look cute to you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.73,0:22:29.28,italics,ED,0,0,0,,(crazy, crazy, drive me crazy, and that's…)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.94,0:22:28.57,italics,ED,0,0,0,,So I'm plotting, bargaining, \Nsly, and stubborn
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.28,0:22:33.08,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Dizzying love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.24,0:22:38.67,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Just tell him to look at you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.67,0:22:43.63,italics,ED,0,0,0,,And watch him stiffen up even more, \Nbecause you're both so awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.63,0:22:47.51,italics,ED,0,0,0,,What? Even if we're alike in that way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:52.10,italics,ED,0,0,0,,It doesn't make me happy, 'cause it\N means our love is going nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:23:00.98,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Cloudy heart, swirling emotions—\NI sense rain coming
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.98,0:23:10.07,italics,ED,0,0,0,,So I partly open my umbrella, \Nthen sneakily scoot closer to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.07,0:23:14.03,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Please notice the curl of my \Neyelashes as I keep blinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.03,0:23:18.96,italics,ED,0,0,0,,And don't say I'm acting weird
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.96,0:23:22.92,italics,ED,0,0,0,,All this plotting and bargaining \Nis my sly plan to look cute to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.92,0:23:27.97,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Try to solve the riddle of \Nthis soft, dizzying love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:30.09,italics,ED,0,0,0,,(Buzzing, fidgeting)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.34,0:23:34.89,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Listen, I might be a bit \Ntangled in my own web now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.89,0:23:38.93,italics,ED,0,0,0,,But once you unravel the mystery, \Nyou'll see pure lo-love
